ll,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["偶然機緣下來附近上課才剛好有機會嘗嘗沒吃過的拉麵店，初訪一前一町，店員服務親切，可能剛好用餐時間所以等了許久麵才上來。\n這次吃的是煮干魚湯牛叉燒拉麵，湯頭帶有淡淡煮干味，配菜吃起來味道普通，麵條有嚼勁我喜歡，牛叉燒是炙燒過的很香很嫩，雖然湯頭味道不濃郁有點過於清淡，但是以這價位來說還不錯囉，適合不常吃重口味拉麵的普羅大眾來吃吃。",null,[0,165]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18059999130257857617/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdlbU5FWkhCUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18059999130257857617/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdlbU5FWkhCUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/18059999130257857617/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdlbU5FWkhCUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18059999130257857617/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdlbU5FWkhCUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18059999130257857617/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdlbU5FWkhCUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18059999130257857617/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdlbU5FWkhCUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,9098,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGemNEZHBRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xc723b594a903b1cb!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDFzcDdpQE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGemNEZHBRRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGemNEZHBRRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGemNEZFpREhNDZ3dJbnRXeHFnWVF1TmE3akFFGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJREZ6Y0RkNVFFEhNDZ3dJbnRXeHFnWVF1TmE3akFFIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARy7EDqZS1I8cqCzBfSTVlVEdZaWdz\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi4sqrt8dSWAxUJb_UHHSkiJ_cQoykIcCgO"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwjb3a7t8dSWAxVCeV4EHT3BIIcQ0pMFCBAoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwi4sqrt8dSWAxUJb_UHHSkiJ_cQ0pMFCFcoAQ"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWNU5XRlViR2RJWjE5eGFYbG5SbXB6U